ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FeelFreeToUsePC::
    .string "You can use that PC in the corner.\p"
    .string "It's free. Well, free with ads.\n"
    .string "Premium costs extra.$"

ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCenterInEveryTown::
    .string "There's a POKéMON CENTER in every\n"
    .string "town ahead.\p"
    .string "They charge ¥300 a heal now.\n"
    .string "Used to be free, back in my day.\p"
    .string "Budget your heals, kid.$"

ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCentersHealMons::
    .string "POKéMON CENTERS heal your tired,\n"
    .string "hurt, or fainted POKéMON.\p"
    .string "If you can pay. If not, your\n"
    .string "POKéMON can tough it out.$"

